        "sender": "Elizabeth",
        "date": "1845-10-27",
        "approximate": true,
        "dateLabel": "c. 27 October 1845",
        "text": "Because as a poem of yours it stands there and wants unity, and people can't be expected to understand the difference between incompleteness and defect, unless you make a sign.",
        "note": "",
        "callbacks": []
      },
      {
        "snippetId": "s2248",
        "messageOrdinal": 150,
        "sender": "Robert",
        "date": "1845-11-17",
        "approximate": false,
        "dateLabel": "17 November 1845",
        "text": "I shall only say I was scheming how to get done with England and go to my heart in Italy.",
        "note": "",
        "callbacks": []
      },
      {
        "snippetId": "s3533",
        "messageOrdinal": 200,
        "sender": "Robert",
        "date": "1846-01-15",
        "approximate": false,
        "dateLabel": "15 January 1846",
        "text": "Will you, and must you have 'Pauline'?",
        "note": "",
        "callbacks": []
      },
      {
        "snippetId": "s3658",
        "messageOrdinal": 203,
        "sender": "Robert",
        "date": "1846-01-17",
        "approximate": false,
        "dateLabel": "17 January 1846",
        "text": "See the bottoms of the other pages!",
        "note": "",
        "callbacks": []
      },
      {
        "snippetId": "s4520",
        "messageOrdinal": 242,
        "sender": "Robert",
        "date": "1846-02-23",
        "approximate": false,
        "dateLabel": "23 February 1846",
        "text": "I know now, what I only suspected then, and will tell you all the matter on Monday if you care to hear.",
        "note": "",
        "callbacks": []
      },
      {
        "snippetId": "s6533",
        "messageOrdinal": 327,
        "sender": "Elizabeth",
        "date": "1846-04-24",
        "approximate": false,
        "dateLabel": "24 April 1846",
        "text": "When she comes, I shall not dare name you, but she will, I think ...",
        "note": "",
        "callbacks": []
      },
      {
        "snippetId": "s9197",
        "messageOrdinal": 446,
        "sender": "Elizabeth",
        "date": "1846-07-08",
        "approximate": false,
        "dateLabel": "8 July 1846",
        "text": "But I did not remember the former opinion.",
        "note": "",
        "callbacks": []
      },
      {
        "snippetId": "s11452",
        "messageOrdinal": 528,
        "sender": "Elizabeth",
        "date": "1846-08-29",
        "approximate": false,
        "dateLabel": "29 August 1846",
        "text": "Poor Papa!—Presently I shall be worse to him than ‘mumpish’ even.",
